{
  "title": "Investigate enrichment authentication failures during local dev seeding",
  "description": "During make dev-headless in the deforest-sandbag worktree, the seed process reported 474 successful imports while server jobs repeatedly failed at enrich_auto_tag with an OpenRouter 401 Missing Authentication header response. \
Recipes were saved and the ready process declared the UI ready, so the design audit could proceed. \
Reproduce with the local dev configuration and determine why optional enrichment was attempted without usable authentication and why seed success does not reflect those asynchronous failures. \
Preserve imported recipe data and follow the existing no-key import behavior. \
Do not include credentials in diagnostics.",
